Comment: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:21.68,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:28.69,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:33.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Ryu, standby okay!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:33.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.86,0:01:38.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, standby for docking.\NReady?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.92,0:01:41.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going in, Mr. Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.50,0:01:43.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,5... 4...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.80,0:01:46.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,3... 2... 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.76,0:01:49.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laser searcher synchronized.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.01,0:01:50.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,5... 4...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.73,0:01:52.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam B Parts released!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.65,0:01:59.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Core Change! Docking, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:11.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Days spent training with comrades...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.53,0:02:14.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...to perfect the mid-air docking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.39,0:02:18.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After deserting the White Base,\Nwill the wayward Amuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.42,0:02:20.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...ever experience those days again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.26,0:02:23.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For an Amuro wandering the battlefield...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:26.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...feelings similar to regret\Nwere beginning to emerge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.01,0:02:56.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.56,0:03:06.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May I have some water to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:09.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't have any to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.13,0:03:11.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a town close by. Buy some there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.79,0:03:13.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.27,0:03:15.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:31.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I get a meal here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:38.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.63,0:03:40.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you agree with everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.96,0:03:42.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:43.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we considering Amuro\Nseparately from the Gundam?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:50.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm... We'll make a decision about Amuro\Nafter we get the Gundam back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.89,0:03:52.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's forget it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.48,0:03:55.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll all depend on\Nhow Amuro feels at that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:58.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:17.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Time to get some food!\N- I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:21.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister. We're taking a break.\NThere're 13 of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.88,0:04:24.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes... Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.02,0:04:29.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hamon, this way please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.91,0:04:49.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Sagred and Mile. You'll keep watch.\NI'll make sure you're relieved soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:50.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Lieutenant Ramba Ral.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.43,0:04:54.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ramba Ral?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:57.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's have some water, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:05:00.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Hamon...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...you must be amazed\Nthat there's a desert this big on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.05,0:05:04.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a marvel of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:06.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Much more interesting than star-gazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.23,0:05:10.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone, at ease! Take a seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:13.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have anything you want.\NIt's the last meal before our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:15.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.26,0:05:17.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before the mission...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.95,0:05:23.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, Sodon is considered neutral territory,\Nso no combat...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:25.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll do it elsewhere. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:28.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have much here...\NWe'll have 14 of whatever you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.54,0:05:29.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.71,0:05:31.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's one too many, Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.90,0:05:33.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One for the boy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:40.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're interested in a boy like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:43.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:58.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:06:01.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the very least, he's gotta eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:07.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that? In a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:14.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, I don't know how to say this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:16.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your generosity...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.51,0:06:18.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but I can't accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.09,0:06:19.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:22.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for you\Nto give me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:27.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The kid's got you there, Hamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.53,0:06:31.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just took a liking to you, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:33.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a good enough reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:35.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.61,0:06:38.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid. It's quite something\Nto be liked by Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.63,0:06:41.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.\NIt's bad karma to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.76,0:06:44.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish I were in your shoes, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:46.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be thankful you were born a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.35,0:06:50.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm not a beggar either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:54.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I like you, kid.\NYou don't mince words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:07:01.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not just from Hamon, it's from me too.\NYou can accept the meal then, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:03.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? I didn't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:05.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant!\NWe found a suspicious person!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:06.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:08.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes! A woman behaving strangely!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.33,0:07:10.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:12.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:17.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's a friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:18.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.54,0:07:21.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she's wearing a Federation uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.59,0:07:24.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure? It looks a little different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.26,0:07:26.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.93,0:07:28.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Hamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.55,0:07:30.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:34.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems she's this boy's girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.02,0:07:35.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:36.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:38.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.23,0:07:39.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:39.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.28,0:07:45.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I like the look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.57,0:07:52.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you've got some guts.\NNow, I'm really impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:54.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:56.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:03.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if we should meet in battle,\Nit will be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:04.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good luck, young Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:11.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mr. Ramba Ral.\NAnd Ms. Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:16.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:18.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.15,0:08:22.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:24.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:25.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go follow them, Zeygan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:29.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only Federation forces around here\Nshould be the Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:31.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:34.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:38.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you to leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:43.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you think everyone will continue\Nto worry about you... you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:46.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the one who got caught by Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:48.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, what were {\i1}you{\i0} doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.72,0:08:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.35,0:08:58.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.77,0:09:05.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't want to hold hands with me\Nbecause that lady was watching, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:06.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.73,0:09:07.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:12.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just getting further and further\Naway from me, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:20.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:22.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to the White Base?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:23.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.04,0:09:26.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Better get back soon,\Nor you'll get sunstroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:28.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll regret this later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:30.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can manage on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.22,0:09:31.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so stubborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:36.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't regret this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.05,0:10:12.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Trojan Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:17.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any news?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:19.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A coded message from Zeygan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:23.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"The wind will blow soon."\NSeems he found the Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.19,0:10:25.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Begin preparations for the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:36.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You saw a Gouf? The enemy mobile suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.37,0:10:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Stowed on two large trailers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:41.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you see Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:43.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I saw him in Sodon as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.46,0:10:50.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bet Amuro told the Zeon folks\Nabout the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.17,0:10:53.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai, enough with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:55.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enemy forces are stalking us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:56.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.39,0:11:00.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should stop maintenance and put the White Base on interception status.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:00.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.93,0:11:03.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow, I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.39,0:11:05.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you can't just go off without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.77,0:11:07.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.07,0:11:16.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's working well.\NStetch! How's your mobile suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:18.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sir! It's running well!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.53,0:11:21.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:24.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right. You guys advance 5 kilometers{\i}\N{\i1}and wait there.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:27.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't use the radio for now.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.25,0:11:28.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.47,0:11:39.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are those people...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.43,0:11:42.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...the enemy we're fighting?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.06,0:11:46.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I just took a liking to you, that's all.{\i}\N{\i1}Is that a problem?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:49.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's quite something{\i}\N{\i1}to be liked by Hamon.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:06.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, they found the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.54,0:12:12.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They must have followed Fraw Bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.23,0:12:38.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If that Gouf mobile suit shows up...\Nthe Guncannon and Guntank are finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:43.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no... It's so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.59,0:12:54.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:12:58.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.09,0:13:04.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu, get us away from White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:05.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:08.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Emergency takeoff!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.89,0:13:09.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.57,0:13:17.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.32,0:13:21.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.28,0:13:23.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy has two mobile suits!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.12,0:13:25.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get any closer to White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.33,0:13:26.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:31.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stetch! I'll leap out...\Nand then you destroy the tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:32.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Lieutenant Ral!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:42.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.85,0:13:47.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu! A caterpillar track was hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:48.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.90,0:13:57.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did it, Lieutenant! I got the tank!\NNow I'll finish him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.40,0:13:59.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haven't you been paying attention? Stetch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.53,0:14:04.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to take out the Trojan Horse,\Nor there's no point to our battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:06.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right, sir...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.41,0:14:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn Zaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.29,0:14:12.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu! I'm doing a forced ejection\Nof the Guntank's upper unit! All right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:14.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Forced ejection?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:17.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hayato! What about you?!{\i}\N{\i1}You can't move!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:20.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu, I've got plenty of ammo left!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:22.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll just act as a turret!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:28.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't waste strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:31.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu, please take the Core Fighter\Nand find Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.02,0:14:33.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! I understand.\NYou could be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.77,0:14:35.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.44,0:14:37.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Launching core block!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:46.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai, cover Hayato and the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:53.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:54.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are the Gouf and Zaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:58.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato! You should get out of there\Nbefore you're killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.17,0:14:59.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.55,0:15:02.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't move, but I still have ammo!\NI'm staying!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:05.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow. How very noble of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:08.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is the enemy up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:15.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.23,0:15:24.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I use the beam rifle now,\Nwhen I fight the Gouf, I won't...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:39.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, do you read?! I'll keep it occupied!\NYou head over to the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.63,0:15:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu came to look for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:49.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ascend. We're escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:16:00.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right on! Even the Trojan Horse can't take\Na direct missile from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One Zaku approaching the stern!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.94,0:16:03.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:05.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about our rear missiles?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:06.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no one there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:07.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's right behind us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.53,0:16:08.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:11.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead! Hang on tight, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.37,0:16:15.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn that Trojan Horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:23.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Careless fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.76,0:16:28.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.43,0:16:34.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato! Kai! Do you read?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.35,0:16:36.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't you hit the Gouf from outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.64,0:16:38.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't destroy it, the White Base will...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.73,0:16:41.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright! I'll shake off the Gouf!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:44.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Mirai, can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:47.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have to fly upside-down.\NPlease fasten your seatbelts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:48.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.86,0:16:50.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:16:59.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Mirai is amazing...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:24.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.61,0:17:30.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the one they call the Gundam!\NWhere was it hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Amuro! Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:40.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn Gouf!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:45.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.46,0:17:50.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's some precise firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:53.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As such, it's easy for the computer to predict.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.34,0:17:55.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's not even dodging them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.56,0:18:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I've only got one shot left anyways...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:07.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This pilot's got some guts!\NA tough opponent!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:08.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.49,0:18:15.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What amazing power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.31,0:18:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.31,0:18:46.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.32,0:19:01.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not bad, Gundam!\NBut my control systems are still intact!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:11.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:16.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're...! That kid from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.39,0:19:18.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your name's Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.26,0:19:20.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:24.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You let us go just so you could\Nfind the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.02,0:19:25.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.35,0:19:29.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Times certainly have changed,\Nwith kids like you fighting as pilots!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.28,0:19:35.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.41,0:19:44.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's he...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:46.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impressive! But remember, kid...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.75,0:19:48.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your own strength didn't win the battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.75,0:19:52.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was the performance of your mobile suit!\NDon't forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:54.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just a sore loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:20:00.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.27,0:20:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have no choice.\NI'll meet up with Hamon later tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:20.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai! Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:21.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.32,0:20:23.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Top priority is to recover Hayato's Guntank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.29,0:20:27.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've taken too much damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.04,0:20:29.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Open a comm circuit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:31.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you to help with the recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.30,0:20:43.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever your reasons were,\Nyou're guilty of damaging our teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:44.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's too one-sided!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.89,0:20:47.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't leave the White Base on a whim!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.43,0:20:49.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to hear my side of it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.52,0:20:51.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.19,0:20:52.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:56.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When Ramba Ral attacks,\NI'll have to pilot the Gundam anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:20:57.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.99,0:20:59.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:02.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you think I went looking for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.91,0:21:05.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because... without me, you can't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.75,0:21:10.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be so conceited.\NWe just wanted the Gundam back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.96,0:21:15.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should think long and hard about that!\NEh, Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.13,0:21:17.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:19.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.84,0:21:21.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.89,0:21:23.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have to do repairs all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.89,0:21:27.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems even that Gallop of theirs\Ngot damaged... but they'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.93,0:21:29.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.27,0:21:30.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will he be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.15,0:21:35.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'd understand if you listened to me!\NLet me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:37.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no need to lock me up in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:42.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright! Or even Ms. Mirai!\NMs. Sayla! Please come!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.45,0:21:43.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please hear me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.91,0:21:45.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ryu! Ms. Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:48.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen to me... I have things to say too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stupid Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.21,0:21:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can hear me on the TV monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Answer me! Ms. Sayla! Ms. Sayla!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.47,0:22:07.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can use...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.31,0:22:11.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...the Gundam...\Nbetter than anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.06,0:22:12.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the best...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.64,0:22:15.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can use it better than anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.49,0:22:32.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't be so conceited!{\i}\N{\i1}Your own strength didn't win the battle!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.75,0:22:35.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You won because of Gundam's performance!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.42,0:22:41.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You've got guts.{\i}\N{\i1}That's why Hamon likes you.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.46,0:22:43.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is my treat, Amuro.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.93,0:22:48.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... I really...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.77,0:22:53.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...want to beat that man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:19.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The enemy finally boards the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.79,0:23:23.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The young crew resists the intruders\Nin the midst of terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.47,0:23:27.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As guns blaze,\Nthe Gundam destroys the Gallop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.89,0:23:30.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the cost of this victory is high...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.56,0:23:33.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...resulting in significant losses for\NAmuro and the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.06,0:23:37.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NHand-to-Hand Combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.06,0:23:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
